15. What Is Next.js? Explain Its Features.

1. Next.js is a React-based framework used to build full-stack web applications.
2. It supports Server-Side Rendering (SSR), Static Site Generation (SSG), and Incremental Static Regeneration (ISR).
3. It provides file-based routing, API routes, image optimization, and code splitting.
4. It improves SEO and initial page loading by allowing pages to be rendered on the server or generated at build time.

